------------------

✔ Behavioral Pattern

✔ Uses Inheritance

✔ Base class defines the workflow

✔ Derived class overrides specific steps

✔ Eliminates duplicate code

✔ Fixed sequence of steps

✔ Hook methods

✔ OCP

✔ SRP

