TOP 5 INTERVIEW TAKEAWAYS
=========================================================

1. Defines the skeleton of a workflow.

2. Base class controls the execution order.

3. Derived classes customize only specific steps.

4. Uses inheritance, not composition.

5. Best suited when the workflow is fixed but
some steps vary.

